# Path-level .gitignore for _archive/pipeline-sessions/
# Built by PARALLEL_PIPELINE_COORDINATION SPEC (2026-05-17) per Brief §6.
#
# Lock files are session-local state, NOT source-of-truth — they
# must never enter git history.
*.lock

# But: keep this folder as a stable audit target.
!.gitkeep

# And: stale-cleanup audit logs ARE tracked for audit history (Brief §3.4 + §6).
!stale-cleanup-*.log

# And: this .gitignore itself stays tracked.
!.gitignore
